# Firebase (PRD §4.1) is @react-native-firebase/*: the native SDKs read
# `apps/mobile/google-services.json` (Android) and `GoogleService-Info.plist`
# (iOS), baked in at build time by the config plugin. Download them from the
# Firebase console → Project settings → Your apps; both are git-ignored
# (PRD §16). There are no EXPO_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_* variables any more.
